{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（10日）早上9時24分，警方接獲太古城廬山閣一名12歲女童報案，稱其母親墮樓倒臥平台。救援人員到場，證實女子當場不治。警方正調查女子墮樓原因。</p><figure><img alt=\"太古城廬山閣一名12歲女童報案，稱其母親墮樓倒臥平台。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141323343903854592094725.jpeg/m9JRkkwor48tLuJSSXgPrTQwjNkbdxV_DyNAySUjQMk\"/><figcaption>太古城廬山閣一名12歲女童報案，稱其母親墮樓倒臥平台。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在中層單位看出窗外。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141327426349961216419720.jpeg/ug0AtYYZgtez6hARgvFaW4gsVLP9Sf3F8PNdqtrzXao\"/><figcaption>警方在中層單位看出窗外。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在場調查。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141323346764500992980762.jpeg/ave_e_k0cYMafFs9L8IBiUi4CC7nNwq2GF7MejJezHo\"/><figcaption>警方在場調查。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"女子當場證實不治。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141323333619421184528379.jpeg/a7BcEjo3UVYtfJgUBVke4rPYdghjf5LKfFRqmVZUapk\"/><figcaption>女子當場證實不治。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方正調查事主墮樓原因。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141323336681394176924607.jpeg/yjcMzlaoA2jpwHpJHHrIo-hAIxTfaKsPM1bmsBlW5rA\"/><figcaption>警方正調查事主墮樓原因。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"救護車在場戒備。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141323355262554112147209.jpeg/2b8g0rEzdAJikqNXIG6Vi5mve9OeLzUyo78p04m_KdM\"/><figcaption>救護車在場戒備。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為太古城廬山閣。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260610/1141323352527736832615478.jpeg/ROdTXDdYwzGGZPP2LEmnwNz7NsO109CKHk1g0zRNYNM\"/><figcaption>現場為太古城廬山閣。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-10T07:20:29.055751+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":208,"images":7,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}